<title>UK: No grain bids through UK board at weekly EU tender.</title>
<headline>No grain bids through UK board at weekly EU tender.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK grain traders placed no bids for free-market grain at the European Union's weekly tender through the UK Intervention Board for Agricultural Produce, it said.</p>
<p>However, traders said bids were being placed by UK houses through their Continental Europe counterparts but could give no details.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
</text>
